OL,3,GNEWSABus wedged in garden hedge after
OL,4,Aveering off road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus remains wedged in someone's
OL,7,Fgarden a day after it veered off the
OL,8,Froad.
OL,10,FThe bus crashed into a driveway of a
OL,11,Fhouse on the A37, in Chilthorne Domer
OL,12,Fin Somerset, at about 12:00 GMT on
OL,13,FSunday. Police confirmed nobody was
OL,14,Finjured in the single-vehicle
OL,15,Fcollision.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for First Bus said the
OL,18,Fcompany was working with emergency
OL,19,Fservices to remove the number 376 bus
OL,20,Ffrom the garden.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
