OL,3,GNEWSABus wedged in garden hedge after
OL,4,Aveering off road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe garden and driveway of the property
OL,7,Fwere damaged in the crash and Avon and
OL,8,FSomerset Police said a nearby
OL,9,Ftelecommunications pole was also being
OL,10,Fassessed. It added that the road would
OL,11,Fremain closed while the scene was
OL,12,Fassessed for safety reasons.
